{
  "description": "Conformity engine — agents on a grid adopt the local majority opinion of their row-ordered neighborhood each step, except a deviance-rate share who deliberately break with it, so the population converges or fragments over repeated steps, on a biology-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
